{
  "id": "1KI.21",
  "number": "21",
  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "1 Kings 21",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Near King Ahab's palace in Jezreel there was a vineyard owned by a man named Naboth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One day Ahab said to Naboth, “Let me have your vineyard; it is close to my palace, and I want to use the land for a vegetable garden. I will give you a better vineyard for it, or, if you prefer, I will pay you a fair price.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I inherited this vineyard from my ancestors,” Naboth replied. “The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " forbid that I should let you have it!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahab went home, depressed and angry over what Naboth had said to him. He lay down on his bed, facing the wall, and would not eat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His wife Jezebel went to him and asked, “Why are you so depressed? Why won't you eat?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered, “Because of what Naboth said to me. I offered to buy his vineyard, or, if he preferred, to give him another one for it, but he told me that I couldn't have it!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Well, are you the king or aren't you?” Jezebel replied. “Get out of bed, cheer up and eat. I will get you Naboth's vineyard!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then she wrote some letters, signed them with Ahab's name, sealed them with his seal, and sent them to the officials and leading citizens of Jezreel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The letters said: “Proclaim a day of fasting, call the people together, and give Naboth the place of honour. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Get a couple of scoundrels to accuse him to his face of cursing God and the king. Then take him out of the city and stone him to death.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The officials and leading citizens of Jezreel did what Jezebel had commanded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They proclaimed a day of fasting, called the people together, and gave Naboth the place of honour. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The two scoundrels publicly accused him of cursing God and the king, and so he was taken outside the city and stoned to death. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The message was sent to Jezebel: “Naboth has been put to death.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As soon as Jezebel received the message, she said to Ahab, “Naboth is dead. Now go and take possession of the vineyard which he refused to sell to you.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At once Ahab went to the vineyard to take possession of it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Elijah, the prophet from Tishbe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Go to King Ahab of Samaria. You will find him in Naboth's vineyard, about to take possession of it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.22.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kgs 22.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell him that I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", say to him, ‘After murdering the man, are you taking over his property as well?’ Tell him that this is what I say: ‘In the very place that the dogs licked up Naboth's blood they will lick up your blood!’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Ahab saw Elijah, he said, “Have you caught up with me, my enemy?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yes, I have,” Elijah answered. “You have devoted yourself completely to doing what is wrong in the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s sight. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says to you, ‘I will bring disaster on you. I will do away with you and get rid of every male in your family, young and old alike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your family will become like the family of King Jeroboam son of Nebat and like the family of King Baasha son of Ahijah, because you have stirred up my anger by leading Israel into sin.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kgs 9.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And concerning Jezebel, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says that dogs will eat her body in the city of Jezreel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Any of your relatives who die in the city will be eaten by dogs, and any who die in the open country will be eaten by vultures.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
